    {
      "id": "p0136-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Inside Snowdin's local restaurant, a dog sits at a table all alone. At first, the dog plays poker against itself, but it switches to other card games as Underta/e's story unfolds. Eventually, in the English script, the dog starts to play Go Fish against itself.",
        "raw": "Inside Snowdin's local restaurant, a dog sits at a table all alone. At first, the dog\nplays poker against itself, but it switches to other card games as Underta/e's\nstory unfolds. Eventually, in the English script, the dog starts to play Go Fish\nagainst itself.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29334937,
          0.26336429,
          0.89723013,
          0.32949286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
