    {
      "id": "p0136-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Go Fish is a card game usually played by two to five players, so the idea of playing it alone is slightly comical. And because Go Fish is so simple to play, it's particularly popular as a children's card game.",
        "raw": "Go Fish is a card game usually played by two to five players, so the idea of\nplaying it alone is slightly comical. And because Go Fish is so simple to play, it's\nparticularly popular as a children's card game.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29351262,
          0.34540714,
          0.89888303,
          0.39406429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28994153,
          0.34469286,
          0.90092365,
          0.39513571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          19,
          20,
          21
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Go Fish 通常要两到五个人玩，一只狗独自玩自然有些好笑。这种游戏规则简单，在孩子中很流行。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
